---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const words=[['State','Express clearly and briefly.','Give the required fact directly.'],['Describe','Set out characteristics.','Say what something is like using relevant detail.'],['Explain','Set out purpose or reasons.','Make the link clear: point, why or how, then consequence.'],['Compare','Identify similarities and differences.','Make direct comparisons rather than two separate descriptions.'],['Justify','Support a case with evidence.','Choose or argue a position and support it using evidence relevant to the context.'],['Analyse','Separate information into components to identify characteristics.','Break the situation down and develop links between important factors.'],['Discuss','Present key points about different ideas or strengths and weaknesses.','Consider more than one side and develop the important points.'],['Evaluate','Judge from available evidence.','Weigh evidence and reach a supported judgement.']];
---
<Base title="Exam Technique | A-level DT"><main class="page"><header><span class="eyebrow">AQA 7552 · EXAM TECHNIQUE</span><h1>Know what the question wants<span>.</span></h1><p>The command word tells you the kind of response the examiner is asking for.</p></header><div class="grid">{words.map(([w,d,t])=><article><span>COMMAND WORD</span><h2>{w}</h2><strong>AQA meaning</strong><p>{d}</p><strong>How to approach it</strong><p>{t}</p></article>)}</div><section class="long"><span>LONG ANSWERS</span><h2>Build developed responses, not lists.</h2><p><b>1. Make the point.</b> Use relevant DT knowledge.</p><p><b>2. Develop it.</b> Explain why it matters or what it causes.</p><p><b>3. Apply it.</b> Connect it directly to the product, user or manufacturing context.</p><p><b>4. Judge when asked.</b> Support your conclusion using the evidence you discussed.</p><a href="/answer-trainer/">Practise a longer answer →</a></section></main></Base><style>.page{padding:48px clamp(24px,6vw,92px) 90px;background:#fbf8f5}.page header{max-width:850px}.page h1{font-size:clamp(45px,5vw,72px);margin:12px 0}.page h1 span{color:#9d62b9}.page header p{font-size:18px;color:#6f6177}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:14px;margin-top:35px}.grid article,.long{background:#fff;border:1px solid #e7dce9;border-radius:14px;padding:28px}.grid span,.long>span{font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.14em;font-weight:800;color:#9363ab}.grid h2{font-size:30px;margin:8px 0 20px}.grid strong{font-size:11px;color:#5d3474}.grid p{color:#665b6b;margin:5px 0 17px}.long{margin-top:28px}.long h2{font-size:34px;margin:8px 0 25px}.long a{display:inline-block;background:#482166;color:#fff;padding:13px 18px;border-radius:7px;font-weight:800;margin-top:15px}@media(max-width:750px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style>